  "details": "CI/CD Workflows are cornerstones of many team projects, especially on industry teams. Having the ability to integrate the VRChat world building process into CI/CD Workflows will help team projects and help attract broader attention from industry. Reducing the friction for industry teams will help encourage them to take on projects in VRChat. Having a CLI build option seems like the only missing piece for supporting CI/CD workflows.",
